build/
dist/
__pycache__/
recovery/
rebuild-*/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
# Editor/one-shot backup copies of source files. These have leaked into the
# public source bundle before (build_public.sh copies src/ verbatim), so they
# are ignored outright rather than trusted to be deleted by hand.
*.bak
# Regenerable research outputs. The three files below totalled ~33 MB of machine-generated
# data (extraction manifest, symbol classification); they are rebuilt by
# tools/build_asset_manifest.py and tools/classify_symbols.py instead of being committed.
# The game's own inventory, reports/fullgame_asset_manifest.csv, stays tracked —
# tools/verify_fullgame_build.py reads it on every build.
reports/asset_manifest.json
reports/asset_manifest.csv
reports/symbol_classification.csv
# FreeJ2ME-Plus runtime state: per-app config and the emulator's own log, both
# generated when the desktop emulator is run and not project sources.
freej2me_system/
config/HoloJava/
# MIDP RecordStore files written by the emulator when the game is run from the
# project directory; runtime state, regenerated on every play session.
rms/
